@startuml
title End-to-End Single AI Agent: X to y
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive natural-language requirement X;
partition "Single AI Requirements Classification Agent" {
  :Data understanding / text preprocessing;
  :TF-IDF feature extraction;
  :Trained SVM or Random Forest inference;
  :Predicted class FR or NFR;
  if (LLM explanation configured?) then (yes)
    :Reasoning - request grounded explanation;
  else (no)
    :Skip generative explanation;
  endif
  :Output generation;
}
:Return y = FR/NFR
and optional explanation;
stop
@enduml
